{"code":"nl-NL","name":"Dutch","native":"Nederlands","badge":"NL","tts":"nl-NL","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Ik begrijp het niet.","say":"ik buh-KHRAYP ut neet","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Ik weet het niet.","say":"ik VAYT ut neet","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Een momentje, alstublieft.","say":"un moh-MENT-yuh, ahl-stew-BLEEFT","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Kunt u dat herhalen?","say":"kunt ew dat hair-HAH-luhn","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Langzamer, alstublieft.","say":"LAHNG-zah-mer, ahl-stew-BLEEFT","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Hoe zeg je “…”?","say":"hoo ZEKH yuh","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Natuurlijk.","say":"nah-TEWR-luk","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Precies.","say":"pruh-SEES","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Ik denk het wel.","say":"ik DENK ut vel","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Echt?","say":"ekht","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Geen probleem.","say":"khayn proh-BLAYM","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Super!","say":"SEW-per","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Waar is {x}?","say":"vahr is {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Ik wil graag {x}.","say":"ik vil KHRAHKH {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Heeft u {x}?","say":"hayft ew {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, alstublieft.","say":"{x}, ahl-stew-BLEEFT","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Ik moet {x}.","say":"ik MOOT {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Mag ik {x}?","say":"MAKH ik {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Ik check het even.","say":"ik CHEK ut AY-vuh","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Ik heb een vergadering.","say":"ik HEP un ver-KHAH-duh-ring","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Is het pittig?","say":"is ut PIT-tikh","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Zonder ui, alstublieft.","say":"ZON-der UY, ahl-stew-BLEEFT","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Wat raadt u aan?","say":"vat RAHT ew ahn","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Ik eet geen vlees.","say":"ik AYT khayn VLAYS","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Hoeveel kost het?","say":"hoo-VAYL KOST ut","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Ik kijk alleen even.","say":"ik KAYK ah-LAYN AY-vuh","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Ik neem het.","say":"ik NAYM ut","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Kan ik pinnen?","say":"kan ik PIN-nuh","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay","lit":"can I pin (pay by card)?"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Is het ver?","say":"is ut VER","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Naar het vliegveld, alstublieft.","say":"nahr ut VLEEKH-felt, ahl-stew-BLEEFT","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"links · rechts · rechtdoor","say":"links · rekhts · rekht-DOHR","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Help!","say":"help","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Er is geen wc-papier.","say":"er is khayn vay-SAY-pah-peer","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Ik voel me niet lekker.","say":"ik VOOL muh neet LEK-ker","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Bel een ambulance, alstublieft.","say":"BEL un ahm-bew-LAHN-suh","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Leuk je te ontmoeten.","say":"luhk yuh tuh ont-MOO-tuh","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Waar kom je vandaan?","say":"vahr KOM yuh van-DAHN","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Wat doe je voor werk?","say":"vat DOO yuh vohr VERK","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Heerlijk!","say":"HAIR-luk","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Hallo.","say":"HAH-loh","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Goedemorgen.","say":"khoo-duh-MOR-khuh","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Hoe gaat het?","say":"hoo KHAHT ut","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ja. · Nee.","say":"yah · nay","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Alstublieft.","say":"ahl-stew-BLEEFT","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Dank je wel.","say":"DANK yuh vel","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Sorry.","say":"SOR-ree","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Tot ziens.","say":"tot SEENS","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"een · twee · drie","say":"ayn · tvay · dree","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"vier · vijf · zes","say":"veer · fayf · zes","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"zeven · acht · negen","say":"ZAY-vuh · ahkht · NAY-khuh","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"tien · twintig · honderd","say":"teen · TVIN-tikh · HON-dert","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"De appel is rood.","say":"duh AP-pul is roht","en":"The apple is red.","note":"de / het = the · the adjective after is doesn’t change"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Ik eet de appel.","say":"ik AYT duh AP-pul","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"the verb sits in second place"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Ik heb de appel gegeten.","say":"ik HEP duh AP-pul khuh-KHAY-tuh","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: hebben + participle at the end"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Ik wil de appel eten.","say":"ik vil duh AP-pul AY-tuh","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper second, infinitive at the end"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Eet jij appels?","say":"ayt yay AP-puls","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"verb first = question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"het toilet","say":"ut twah-LET","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"de apotheek","say":"duh ah-poh-TAYK","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"het ziekenhuis","say":"ut ZEE-kuh-hows","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"het station","say":"ut stah-SHON","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"het vliegveld","say":"ut VLEEKH-felt","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"het hotel","say":"ut hoh-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"water","say":"VAH-ter","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"een koffie","say":"un KOF-fee","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"de rekening","say":"duh RAY-kuh-ning","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"de menukaart","say":"duh muh-NEW-kahrt","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"een biertje","say":"un BEER-tyuh","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"dit","say":"dit","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"een tasje","say":"un TAH-shuh","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"de vergadering","say":"duh ver-KHAH-duh-ring","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"het bestand","say":"ut buh-STANT","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"het scherm","say":"ut SKHERM","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"het bericht","say":"ut buh-RIKHT","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"morgen","say":"MOR-khuh","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"gaan","say":"khahn","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"binnenkomen","say":"BIN-nuh-koh-muhn","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"betalen","say":"buh-TAH-luhn","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Allergie · lees dit alstublieft","ask":"Zit er een van deze ingrediënten in dit gerecht?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Hartelijk dank!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Ik heb een ernstige pinda-allergie. Ik mag geen pinda’s of pindaolie eten.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Ik heb een ernstige allergie voor schaal- en schelpdieren (garnalen, krab, mosselen).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Ik mag geen gluten eten (tarwe, gerst, rogge).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Ik eet geen vlees, kip of vis.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Ik eet geen varkensvlees.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOILETTEN · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"DAMES · HEREN","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"UITGANG · INGANG","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"DUWEN · TREKKEN","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"NOODUITGANG","en":"Emergency exit"}]}